<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>BkDios</Major>
    <Description>Poteo para mu online (Curacion para servidores Mu Online)

Macro de poteo (Curacion)

Q W E R

Velocidad de 15 Ms entre letras 


Curacion para Seasons con 4 letras de poteo :p
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Macro de Poteo de 4 letras :p</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 20 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 14 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>MU Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>